            "question": "What is MarTech, and how can it support global growth?",
            "answer": "<p>MarTech brings strategy, technology, data and execution together to help businesses attract, convert and retain customers. For businesses expanding across markets, it connects websites, marketing, customer operations and data into a more measurable growth system.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
